eans that if something is both cold and smart, it is also kind.\n\nNow, let\'s analyze the information about Fiona:\n- Fiona is quiet (from point 7).\n- Since Fiona is quiet, she is also cold (from point 4).\n- Since Fiona is cold and quiet, she is smart (from point 5).\n- Since Fiona is smart, she is also big (from point 6).\n- Since Fiona is big and smart, she is cold (from point 6).\n- Since Fiona is cold, she is also red (from point 3).\n- Since Fiona is red, she is also kind (from point 8).\n\nTherefore, Fiona is both kind and smart. The statement "Fiona is smart" is true based on the given information.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
